502 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 412 0 R
/T (Spending two week conducting marine research in Belize this past summer was an unforgettable experience that pushed me outside of my comfort zone both academically and personally. I had the opportunity to conduct hands-on field research in a completely new environment, studying marine life firsthand and turning our observations into my first ever scientific research paper. The experience strengthened my research, scientific writing, and critical thinking skills while giving me a new appreciation for field biology. It was incredibly rewarding to see a research project develop from observations in the ocean to a completed paper that I was proud of.)
/E (Spending two week conducting marine research in Belize this past summer was an unforgettable experience that pushed me outside of my comfort zone both academically and personally. I had the opportunity to conduct hands-on field research in a completely new environment, studying marine life firsthand and turning our observations into my first ever scientific research paper. The experience strengthened my research, scientific writing, and critical thinking skills while giving me a new appreciation for field biology. It was incredibly rewarding to see a research project develop from observations in the ocean to a completed paper that I was proud of.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
